WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.269
Use a four-step habit.

2
00:00:01.269 --> 00:00:04.788
First, parse only the fields that an official source defines.

3
00:00:04.788 --> 00:00:09.115
Second, identify the object: repository, family, product, or configuration.

4
00:00:09.115 --> 00:00:16.210
Third, confirm instruction set, privilege modes, interfaces, issue width, and memory system in the configuration documents.

5
00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:19.729
Fourth, qualify the claim with release and maturity evidence.

6
00:00:19.729 --> 00:00:26.075
This conservative habit lets a beginner read names confidently without giving an expert a misleading shortcut.

